        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 4. *Tr into each ch-1 space, ch 1*. Repeat. Tr into 3rd ch of turning chain. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Row 2 for 16 rows (approximately 20 cm). Fasten off."
